          "line": 65,
          "end": 100,
          "doc": "Optional stricter profile: each pinned pool belongs only to these runs.\nInitial balance zero, recognized cost zero; exact revision chain and current row.\nNo inference about other pools, external effects or actual financial accounting."
        },
        {
          "name": "inspect_plan_history",
          "kind": "FunctionDef",
          "line": 103,
          "end": 158,
          "doc": "Validate exact persisted agent roster and all pinned run histories.\nUnadmitted agents must have exact QUEUED head and no scoped artifacts.\nHuman/IV are gates, never agent runs. Current supported replay has no success\nauthority: descendants cannot progress on a bare SUCCEEDED head. Optional\nexclusive pool replay verifies all known mutations of pinned sample pools.\nA single consistent snapshot is an explicit caller precondition."
        }
